 "keys_text": {
  "text": "按 Space 或向下箭头，前进一张幻灯片。按向上箭头，退回一张。按 / 键，打开搜索。按 C 跳到副歌，按 V 跳到下一个主歌，按 B 跳到桥段。按数字 1 到 9，跳到对应的段落。按 F1 隐藏文字，按 F2 变黑屏，按 F3 显示标志，按 F6 开启或关闭投影屏。",
  "back": "Press Space or the down arrow to go forward one slide. The up arrow goes back one. The / key opens the search. C jumps to the chorus, V to the next verse, B to the bridge. The digits 1 to 9 jump to that part. F1 hides the words, F2 makes the screen black, F3 shows the emblem, F6 switches the projector on or off.",
  "why": "key names as printed"
 },
